/// Single Dart seam for the typed sequencer/run event surface.
///
/// The typed event union (`SkotiqEvent` + `EventPayload_*` variants) and
/// its display helpers are authored in `package:skotiq_bridge` because the
/// union variants are generated by flutter_rust_bridge from the Rust event
/// definitions. App and headless UI code, however, should never reach across to
/// `package:skotiq_bridge` for them — `skotiq_core` is the seam every
/// consumer already depends on, and routing the types through here keeps the
/// bridge an implementation detail of the backend layer.
///
/// This re-exports the bridge's own types (no wrappers), every event variant
/// included, so a variant added in Rust is visible here without an edit.
///
/// `SkotiqEvent`, `EventCategory` and `EventSeverity` are in
/// `bridge_event_union.dart`: the wire/JSON event model
/// (`src/models/backend/event_types.dart`) has types of the same three names.
library;

export 'package:skotiq_bridge/events.dart'
    hide SkotiqEvent, EventCategory, EventSeverity, FrameType;
